sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Daraja
    participant W as Webhook /mpesa/stk-callback
    participant P as Parse Callback
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant IF as IF (success?)
    participant N as Notify (SMS/WhatsApp)
    participant S as Slack ops

    D->>W: POST stkCallback payload
    W-->>D: 200 OK (On Received)
    W->>P: Nested body
    P->>DB: UPDATE mpesa_transactions<br/>WHERE checkout_request_id = ?
    DB-->>IF: row with status
    IF-->>N: on success → confirm
    IF-->>S: on failure → alert
    P->>DB: INSERT mpesa_callbacks (audit)

